<article class="px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-content">
          About.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">
          Who's running this thing.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/65 leading-relaxed">
          Hey! I'm Real Limoges. Nominally a software engineer;
          I design machine learning systems for a living.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/65 leading-relaxed">
          This site is where I think out loud. Emergent things,
          mostly -- color, moods, flocks, that sort of thing.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/65 leading-relaxed">
          I describe my code as lego blocks. Mine are unconventional
          ones: WASM, Haskell, Elixir, that sort of thing.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/65 leading-relaxed">
          Sharing it is more fun than not. Glad you stopped by!
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/65 italic mt-8">
          - Real
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-1 flex justify-center md:justify-start">
      <canvas
        id="lego-stack"
        class="w-full max-w-[320px] aspect-square"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
